      "text": "It's time to give your 3D printing workshop an upgrade with the Workshop Modification Kit! This kit contains medium sized bearings, a thermometer hygrometer, LED solderless quick connector, magnets, pneumatic fittings, desiccant, adhesive foam sponge strip and silicone tube. Whether you need to make your own filament spool winder, drybox, AMS stand, hanging light, tool box or temperature and humidity monitoring kit, this kit will provide you with the parts you need to create the most impressive workshop."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Applications:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "AMS Riser: Use the LED strip to light up the printer. Add drawers and magnets to organise your tools."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Filament Spool Winder: Use deep groove ball bearings to keep the filament spool rolling smoothly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Drybox: Pneumatic connectors, adhesive foam sponge strip and desiccant will help you keep your filament dry. Add a circular thermometer hygrometer to monitor the environment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Tool Boxes & Hangers: Magnets can be used to create self-returning tool boxes, magnetic hangers, and use adhesive foam sponge strips to reduce noise and prevent slipping."
    }
