  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h1 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h1>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><br/><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/3f338b974f2d47828996c91df4b30b29/Workshop_Modification_Kit-B-ZH048_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> 3D Model </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<p> </p>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">It's time to give your 3D printing workshop an upgrade with the Workshop Modification Kit! This kit contains medium sized bearings, a thermometer hygrometer, LED solderless quick connector, magnets, pneumatic fittings, desiccant, adhesive foam sponge strip and silicone tube. <br/>Whether you need to make your own filament spool winder, drybox, AMS stand, hanging light, tool box or temperature and humidity monitoring kit, this kit will provide you with the parts you need to create the most impressive workshop.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"BjvldvnAaoycINxd2bmcCShOnbh\">\n<p> </p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BwfmdgWaBoENgux5o5mcfW39nhl\"><strong>Applications:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AMS Riser: </strong>Use the LED strip to light up the printer. Add drawers and magnets to organise your tools.</li>\n<li><strong>Filament Spool Winder: </strong>Use deep groove ball bearings to keep the filament spool rolling smoothly.</li>\n<li><strong>Drybox:  </strong>Pneumatic connectors, adhesive foam sponge strip and desiccant will help you keep your filament dry. Add a circular thermometer hygrometer to monitor the environment.</li>\n<li><strong>Tool Boxes &amp; Hangers:  </strong>Magnets can be used to create self-returning tool boxes, magnetic hangers, and  use adhesive foam sponge strips to reduce noise and prevent slipping.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 285px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Item Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Quantity</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 39.1875px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/high-performance-bearings?_pos=1&amp;_sid=6510669d7&amp;_ss=r&amp;variant=42489168232584\" style=\"color: #00ae